    "Every text field on this form uses the same 24-box character-row grid (x_start=180.6, box_width=15.35pt) except Aadhaar (12 boxes), DOB (grouped 2/2/4), and the phone number (grouped 3/10). Email has no boxes on the template, so it is drawn as plain text.",
    "PAN_ADDRESS is a single free-text canonical answer, expected as three comma-separated parts (Flat/Building, Street/Area, Locality/City — see FORM_KB.FORM_FIELD.explanation for field_id 14). Each part is placed in its own boxed row via 'csv_part' extraction. Post Office and District rows have no corresponding canonical field and are left blank.",
